Package: coniv
Type: Package
Title: Multicenter Calibration Outcome Natural Instrumental Variable Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CON-IV", "Authors", email = "coniv-authors@example.invalid", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates common causal effects across observational centers that
    share a randomized or interventional reference sample. The implementation
    supports continuous outcomes and binary-outcome risk differences, four
    calibration-variable strategies, influence-function covariance estimation,
    and feasible generalized least squares with full cross-center covariance.
